---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<section class="w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-5 px-4 pt-10 sm:pt-16 pb-8 text-center">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <Image 
        src="/EwwiiLogo.png" 
        width={64}
        height={64} 
        alt="Ewwii Logo" 
        class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 object-contain" 
        loading="eager" 
        fetchpriority="high" 
        />
        <h1 class="text-6xl sm:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-base-content">
            Eww<span class="text-primary">ii</span>
        </h1>
    </div>

    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed max-w-lg mx-auto">
    Ewwii is a lightweight, extensible, and easy-to-use widget system for building interactive widgets, status bars, and more on both Wayland and X11 quickly.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-3 w-full sm:w-auto px-4 sm:px-0">
        <a href="/docs/" class="btn btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto">Get Started</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/Ewwii-sh" class="btn btn-outline w-full sm:w-auto">View on GitHub</a>
    </div>

    <div class="mockup-code w-full text-start md:block hidden">
        <pre data-prefix="$"><code># Quick install</code></pre>
        <pre data-prefix="$"><code>sh -c "$(curl -fsSL https://ewwii-sh.github.io/install.sh)"</code></pre>
    </div>
</section>

